      "post_subject": "Copies of a hologram",
      "content_md": "Contact copies are pretty easy to do unless it is a security hologram. They are very difficult to produce. \n\nIf you posted a picture of your hologram it would help us decide.\n\nDo you want it in DCG or SIlver Halide?\n\nDo you want it in film or plate?\n\nIs it a rainbow, or full color, or monochromatic?\n\nDo you want the final color to be the same?",
